{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0423_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7820327e2e8f2d5cd26523bcd9fe5dcdeca4b02e230d42055a9b9ff2cc1f9406", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の企画で、星梨花が\n紅茶専門店でウェイトレスを体験することになった）", "zh": "（在写真杂志《アイグラ！！》的企划中，星梨花要在红茶专卖店体验当女服务员）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0423_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "2e2b85b14ebd31a2bd17773ee88d99c11bb2edd25f18e46286094d35604614d5", "ja": "すぅー……はぁ。いい香り……。\nお店が紅茶で満たされてるみたいです……♪", "zh": "呼——……哈。好香啊……。\n感觉整间店都被红茶的香气填满了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0423_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3fe28a05bb0f37c20169f89109edbd8b3ffaf3ed028b7366bd37dad3cb3083da", "ja": "ああ。さすが紅茶の専門店だな。\n500種類以上の茶葉を揃えてるって聞いたけど……。", "zh": "啊，不愧是红茶专卖店啊。\n听说这里备有500种以上的茶叶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0423_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "4f75c600704f52c46268cec630b33eff956fe8e033cd1cd718a2a6b16cf92953", "ja": "そうなんです！　さっき、お店の人に見せてもらったん\nです。いろいろな紅茶の缶がたくさん並んでました！", "zh": "就是这样！刚才店里的人还让我看了看呢。店里摆满了各种各样的红茶罐子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0423_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "a0b68795cc5c568285369d53d8bccfcc811050493825989100c53a5e25bdcf8e", "ja": "でも、知らない種類がいっぱいあって……。\nわたし、ちゃんと上手に淹れられるでしょうか……？", "zh": "可是，有好多我不认识的种类……  \n我真的能把它们泡好吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0423_1005_p", "source_sha256": "07e48ef60310c84965bb069793781e5aed3c8fde18f848d5fc72b30f3f6fb4c7", "ja": "心配しなくても大丈夫だよ。\n星梨花が淹れてくれるお茶は、いつも美味しいよ。", "zh": "不用担心，没关系的。\n星梨花泡的茶，一直都很好喝哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0423_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "6b7a27fcbf1f15ab295fa609884fd8e65bdf8508a895f3a3f1f65b0897fefbad", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}さん。\nでもわたし、お店の人たちみたいに上手には……。", "zh": "谢谢您，{$P$}先生。\n但我还是做不到像店里的人那样熟练……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0423_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f87bae7bd0c5e5c718818bdd1b2bb96ff836a05f970a81baffabf99e06920c9a", "ja": "うーん……星梨花にひとつ質問だ。\n星梨花は、どんな紅茶が一番おいしいと思う？", "zh": "嗯……我想问星梨花一个问题。\n星梨花觉得哪种红茶最好喝？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0423_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "acbec13395c8c15c38d9ffbced2fab9d4d60ca6ced69d7a16a5543068c7535e5", "ja": "一番ですか？　えーっと……わたしは、\nフルーティーな香りの紅茶が好きですけど……。", "zh": "最好喝的吗？呃……我喜欢带有水果香气的红茶，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0423_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "bf44141892f6fd5cb1bc583235f8bb6292547aae71b88b606953847a8e885377", "ja": "でも、どんな種類の茶葉でも……家族や劇場のみんなと\n飲む紅茶が、一番おいしいと思います。", "zh": "不过，不管是什么种类的茶叶……和家人以及剧场的大家一起喝的红茶，我觉得才是最好喝的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0423_1010_p", "source_sha256": "a33ec7eaead87412e4f5e1d2e68e55c6dd12d6f912be048ce6c271c030916355", "ja": "ああ、俺もそう思うよ。味も大事だけど、きっと\nお客さんが飲む時の雰囲気も大事だと思うんだ。", "zh": "啊，我也这么觉得。味道固然重要，但我想，客人喝茶时的氛围肯定也很重要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0423_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "0d943320a58acba29528f803b0c7b285c956f8dfeb511ba236ceb6205be1ac5b", "ja": "雰囲気、ですか？", "zh": "氛围……是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0423_1012_p", "source_sha256": "9d4b24d4ad2ef31ac29ea73d8b1763d2d27341a10c5473f4113e9f3ca987d3d3", "ja": "ああ。家族やみんなと飲む時みたいに、紅茶と一緒に\n温かい気持ちを提供するのも大切じゃないかな。", "zh": "嗯。就像和家人、大家一起喝茶时那样，和红茶一起为大家带来温暖的心情，也很重要吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0423_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "782a08a7242c8bd0d916dd3df259874a63c5ff20a6766e6f89273fab7c328cdc", "ja": "温かい気持ち……。そうですね。わたしが不安な顔を\nしてたら、お客さんにも伝わっちゃいますよね……。", "zh": "温暖的心情……确实如此。如果我露出不安的表情，也会传达给客人的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0423_1014_p", "source_sha256": "63a7f76dcc7380ccf9129bae10abd31057862e50650270dea6ccf67ea908b3e7", "ja": "その通り。星梨花が、お客さんのことを考えて淹れれば\nきっと美味しい紅茶になるはずだ。", "zh": "没错。只要星梨花想着客人的心情去泡，红茶一定会很好喝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0423_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "e5c8db531d97e225641d019d60898242257da56920633cc0b31caa860a49484b", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}さん！\nわたし、紅茶の淹れ方はまだまだですけど……。", "zh": "谢谢您，{$P$}先生！\n虽然我沏红茶的手艺还差得很远……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0423_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "7e0e502f079d463d47a3c7fdea3e60b850c1d96c438dc3ff25c9002045b568c0", "ja": "笑顔でおもてなしなら、自信があるんです！\nみなさんに楽しいティータイムをお届けしちゃいます♪", "zh": "要说用笑容待客的话，我可是很有自信的！\n一定会为大家带来愉快的茶话会♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
